            "review_text": "Trip06748430138\n1 contribution\n0\nI always come back\nAug 2026 • Friends\nGreat atmosphere, friendly staff, delicious food\nWritten August 11, 2026\nChay Garden\nDear Mr./Ms. Trip06748430138,\n\nThank you for choosing Chay Garden and for your kind words about our food. We're delighted to hear that you enjoyed your dining experience with us.\n\nReviews like yours are a great source of motivation for our team to continue striving each day to deliver the best possible experience to all our guests.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you again in the near future. Wishing you good health and peace always.\n\nWarm regards,\nRead more\nWritten August 12, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
