            "review_title": "Review at Chay Garden Xuân Thủy - Vegetarian Buffet & Tea House",
            "review_text": "Thao N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam48 contributions\n0\nGreat experience and food\nJul 2026 • Friends\nAmazing food with a great serene atmosphere with a lovely garden. I love the decor, which is rustic but refined, blending natural textures with elegant touches throughout the space. Staff were really lovely as well, attentive without being intrusive, and happy to offer recommendations from the menu. The neighborhood is a lively expat area, surrounded by interesting shops, bars, and eateries, making it easy to combine a meal here with a relaxed evening stroll afterward. Overall a wonderful spot, perfect for a quiet dinner or catching up with friends over drinks. Highly recommend visiting on a warm evening, each time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 14, 2026\nChay Garden\nDear Mr./Ms thaon27,\n\nThank you so much for visiting Chay Garden and for taking the time to share such a thoughtful and detailed review of your experience.\n\nYour heartfelt words are not only a great source of encouragement for the Chay Garden team but also a wonderful way to introduce our plant-based cuisine to many other diners.\n\nIt brings us double the joy to know that you had a truly satisfying experience, savoring the meal with all your senses.\n\nIn return for the trust and love from our valued guests, Chay Garden is committed to continuously improving the quality of our dishes and service every single day. We sincerely look forward to welcoming you back soon for even more fulfilling and memorable experiences.\n\nWarm regards,\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
