            "review_text": "Anthony T\n3 contributions\n0\nBeautiful experience\nJul 2026 • Friends\nThe food was great and the atmosphere beautiful. The staff were really great at service. Place is well recommended and could probably come here again and again. The best place in D2 for sure. \n\nThe best place to take friends and allow people to chill out. I would highly recommend to all to come here and experience for yourself. \n\nTry all the different dishes and the best thing to get is the lotus chips. Please come here. \n\nSpring rolls were great and the the top of the list was the drinks.\n\nIf you come to D2 you should definitely come here and experience for yourself.\nRead more\nWritten July 14, 2026\nChay Garden\nDear Mr./Ms anthonytQ2259PJ,\n\nThank you so much for visiting Chay Garden and for taking the time to share such a thoughtful and detailed review of your experience.\n\nYour heartfelt words are not only a great source of encouragement for the Chay Garden team but also a wonderful way to introduce our plant-based cuisine to many other diners.\n\nIt brings us double the joy to know that you had a truly satisfying experience, savoring the meal with all your senses.\n\nIn return for the trust and love from our valued guests, Chay Garden is committed to continuously improving the quality of our dishes and service every single day. We sincerely look forward to welcoming you back soon for even more fulfilling and memorable experiences.\n\nWarm regards,\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
